						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#408">Need people</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							We need people, it's that simple. Somehow it seems that we manage to obtain people for a short amount of time and then they leave, but in general there is a core group of maybe 15 or so that has been around since the begining or has become good friends with those, we need more people to join because that group is too diverse as far as levels go to be able to do much in a raid.<br />
<br />
oh, and we had so few people show up the the raid that there was no raid.
